# Module 1 (CCACCAGGAGAUCCAGCUAAGCAUAGGGG) is GC heavy.
# For module 3, build an AU-heavy version that still folds locally.
# Structure: ((.((.((....)).((...))...))))
# pairs: (0,28)(1,27)(3,26)(4,25)(6,23)(7,22)(11,18)(12,17)(19,16?) let me index
